Package: rmnchfunding
Title: Tools For Reproducible RMNCH Funding Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Meltem", "Odabaş", , "me@meltemodabas.net", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6123-0676"))
Description: Calculates bilateral and multilateral funding for reproductive,
    maternal, newborn and child health (RMNCH), sexual and reproductive health
    and rights (SRHR) and family planning from OECD Creditor Reporting System
    (CRS) flows and OECD providers' total use of the multilateral system, using
    the revised Muskoka method. Ships the sector and multilateral-agency
    coefficient tables the method depends on, versioned by methodology vintage
    and adjustable by the user.
